# what: Jashiin's damage path (#111): `jashiin_fight`'s route (Pureza mouth rewritten to MP84, the (30,5) door, MP90, MPA0) with LV 99, LIFE 4000, sword 6, then the autopilot's `boss` step (fight_lookahead on MAO2) swinging at him: sword hits take HP /2 (A362), the hit flash on the body parts only (A763), phase 2 below 200 HP (AC32: he stays visible, keeps 8 columns, jumps at walls), the 80-HP regeneration every 32 frames (AB88) up to 800 and phase 1 again (frame 2101), stale boss markers still touching the hero (7643).  The autopilot never lands the last blow (his regeneration outpaces it), so no kill; the script is the autopilot's, cut at 2150 frames.
